 - 5V supply output for ECU sensors\n\nLS1-8, LS13-16 - Medium power low-side outputs, no diode (injectors, relays, etc)\nLS9-12, A-D - High power low-side outputs with freewheel diode (VVT, Idle, PWM solenoids, etc)\nHS1-4 - Medium power high side outputs\nTEXT 5p header\nplacement markers\n{'Reference': 'P6', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '91.44', '180.34', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J5', 'Value': 'Conn_01x07', 'Footprint': 'Connector_PinHeader_2.54mm:PinHeader_1x07_P2.54mm_Vertical', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '383.54', '175.26', '0']\n{'Reference': 'P3', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '92.71', '195.58', '0']\n{'Reference': 'R3', 'Value': '~', 'Footprint': 'Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': ''} ['at', '171.45', '189.23', '0']\n{'Reference': 'P2', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '99.06', '193.04', '0']\n{'Reference': 'P4', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '92.71', '171.45', '0']\n{'Reference': 'C1', 'Value': '1u', 'Footprint': 'Capacitor_SMD:C_0805_2012Metric', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C28323'} ['at', '171.45', '195.58', '90']\n{'Reference': 'J8', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '220.98', '213.36', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J11', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '233.68', '213.36', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J10', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '233.68', '208.28', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J9', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '233.68', '203.2', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J1', 'Value': 'Molex_112_643330100', 'Footprint': 'Simon:Molex_112_643330100', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C293656'} ['at', '34.29', '63.5', '90']\n{'Reference': 'U2', 'Value': 'f042_wideband_module', 'Footprint': 'fome_modules:f042_wideband_module', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': ''} ['at', '177.8', '232.41', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J12', 'Value': 'P1x5', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x5 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C50950'} ['at', '252.095', '203.2', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J13', 'Value': 'P1x5', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x5 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C50950'} ['at', '264.795', '203.2', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J6', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '220.98', '203.2', '0']\n{'Reference': 'U1', 'Value': 'f042_wideband_module', 'Footprint': 'fome_modules:f042_wideband_module', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': ''} ['at', '114.3', '232.41', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J2', 'Value': 'Polygonus ECU Module', 'Footprint': 'fome_modules:polygonus', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': ''} ['at', '264.16', '146.05', '0']\n{'Reference': 'C2', 'Value': '56u', 'Footprint': 'Capacitor_THT:CP_Radial_D8.0mm_P3.50mm', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '', 'PN': 'EEH-AZF1H560B', 'LCSC': 'N/A'} ['at', '186.69', '195.58', '0']\n{'Reference': 'F1', 'Value': 'Fuse', 'Footprint': 'Fuse:Fuseholder_Blade_Mini_Keystone_3568', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C5249699'} ['at', '114.3', '199.39', '90']\n{'Reference': 'A1', 'Value': 'Pololu_Breakout_DRV8825', 'Footprint': 'Module:Pololu_Breakout-16_15.2x20.3mm', 'Datasheet': 'https://www.pololu.com/product/2982', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'N/A'} ['at', '48.26', '234.95', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J3', 'Value': 'Conn_01x05_Male', 'Footprint': 'Connector_PinHeader_2.00mm:PinHeader_1x05_P2.00mm_Vertical', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '341.63', '140.97', '0']\n{'Reference': 'P5', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '95.25', '177.8', '0']\n{'Reference': 'R2', 'Value': '1k', 'Footprint': 'Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C17513'} ['at', '33.02', '233.68', '0']\n{'Reference': 'P1', 'Value': 'Pad', 'Footprint': 'Simon:PAD-TH', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': ''} ['at', '88.9', '203.2', '0']\n{'Reference': 'R4', 'Value': '~', 'Footprint': 'Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': ''} ['at', '171.45', '195.58', '0']\n{'Reference': 'R1', 'Value': '1k', 'Footprint': 'Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric', 'Datasheet': '', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C17513'} ['at', '22.86', '242.57', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J7', 'Value': 'P1x16', 'Footprint': 'header_placement:header_loc', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '1x16 pin socket', 'LCSC': 'C350305'} ['at', '220.98', '208.28', '0']\n{'Reference': 'J4', 'Value': 'USB_B', 'Footprint': 'Simon:BMM-USB', 'Datasheet': '~', 'Description': '', 'LCSC': 'C46392'} ['at', '356.87', '103.505', '0']\n# FOME 112-pin Universal ECU Base\n\n> NOT COMPATIBLE WITH ANY PNP APPLICATION\n\nThis is an open-source ECU base board compatible with [Polygonus](https://github.com/FOME-Tech/Polygonus) and [Atlas](https://github.com/mck1117/atlas) ECU brain modules.\n\nIt is intended to be wired-in to a custom wiring harness, or an OEM harness with the connectors cut off and replaced.\n\n## Features\n\n### Connectivity\n\n- USB-B\n- Dual CAN\n\n### Inputs\n\n- Dual wideband O2 sensor controllers using [open source module](https://github.com/mck1117/wideband) (connected internally to CAN bus #2)\n- Dual VR crank/cam sensor inputs. VR input 2 uses adjustable threshold, suitable for low tooth count (single tooth cam, etc) applications (LS12 unavailable if used)\n- 11x analog voltage inputs (weak pulldown to ground to avoid floating)\n- 4x analog temperature inputs (2.7k pullup resistor to 5v)\n- 6 digital inputs with integrated 2.7k pullup resistor to 5v. Use for hall cam/crank sensors, switches, etc.\n\n### Outputs\n\n- 2x electronic throttle body H-bridge drivers\n- 20 lowside outputs (LS1-16), 8 with freewheel diodes (LS9-12 and IGN9-12)\n- 8 logic level ignition outputs (IGN1-8)\n- 8 ignition \"dumb coil\" IGBT drivers (IGN1-8, shared function with logic outputs, independent output pins)\n- Stepper motor driver for stepper idle (LS9/10 outputs unavailable if used)\nIndependent circuit review; candidate read-only.\nCommands: file inventory with rg; Python JSON inspection of full native ERC/DRC reports.\nNo candidate files modified.\n['python3', '--version']\nPython 3.12.3\n\n['kicad-cli', 'version']\n10.0.7\n\n['ngspice', '--version']\n******\n** ngspice-42 : Circuit level simulation program\n** Compiled with KLU Direct Linear Solver\n** The U. C. Berkeley CAD Group\n** Copyright 1985-1994, Regents of the University of California.\n** Copyright 2001-2023, The ngspice team.\n** Please get your ngspice manual from https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/docs.html\n** Please file your bug-reports at http://ngspice.sourceforge.net/bugrep.html\n** Creation Date: Sun Mar 31 20:15:14 UTC 2024\n******\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
